GRAMMAR.md §5.2, §7.2 (DECISIONS 332): project.local.canon at the project root holds the project declaration only; elsewhere a file of that name is an ordinary source.
-- project.local.canon --
project x {
  roots {
    a: "/a"
  }
}
let y = 1
-- sub/project.local.canon --
package sub
-- findings.txt --
error[E1011]  project.local.canon:6:1
  project.local.canon may only contain the project declaration

